  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Becoming continues, altering your very nature on a permanent basis, both physical and metaphysical.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Cocoon Pact, base attack bonus +7, Minor Becoming.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Reaching within yourself, you can temporarily assume a template thematically associated with your own personal evolution. Choose one simple template (subject to GM approval) such as (but not limited to) anarchic, celestial, fiendish, giant, or resolute. This choice is permanent and cannot be changed, though this feat may be selected multiple times, each time selecting a new template. 1/day as a standard action you may take upon this template for 1/hour per point of Charisma bonus, including both the mechanical effects as well as thematic elements in terms of appearance.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
